======================================================================

1. F-01 quote check            (about 10 lines, removes three failing rows and one wrong grounding signal)
2. F-04 duplicates             (load-time hash, sources_block dedupe; fixes TC-054, 058, 093, 094, 068)
3. F-02 trend sort + F-05 relevance gate (TC-020, 022, 089; also 085 and 017 with the attribution change)
4. F-03 ordered-items memory   (TC-026, 068)
5. F-07 volumes and F-10 tokenizer (TC-057, 073, 078)
6. F-11 prompt wording         (TC-007)
7. F-09 year rule + recompute Corpus Facts
8. F-12 catalog route          (TC-025, 091)
9. F-08 tag handling, F-14 usage message, F-15 stale text, then re-run and update the workbook.

After items 1 to 5 the 22 failing rows should drop to about 6 (TC-007 and TC-025 depend on 6
and 8; TC-050 on the crash).
